{"ok":true,"hero":{"id":159,"name":"朵莉亚","title":"人鱼之歌","pinyin":"duoliya","types":["辅助"],"lanes":["游走"],"skinCount":4,"icon":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/159/159.jpg","skins":[{"name":"人鱼之歌","big":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/skin/hero-info/159/159-bigskin-1.jpg"},{"name":"金色潮汐","big":"https://game-1255653016.file.myqcloud.com/manage/compress/custom_wzry_A1/a6d3ad002603c3bef6564490bf122227.jpg","bigAlt":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/skin/hero-info/159/159-bigskin-2.jpg"},{"name":"心动手记","big":"https://game-1255653016.file.myqcloud.com/manage/compress/custom_wzry_A1/0123aa42b7da349953aedbb0f78e7673.jpg","bigAlt":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/skin/hero-info/159/159-bigskin-3.jpg"},{"name":"幻珠鲛人","big":"https://game-1255653016.file.myqcloud.com/manage/compress/custom_wzry_A1/818cfd0dd6110ccbeb16fcb4d7383445.jpg","bigAlt":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/skin/hero-info/159/159-bigskin-4.jpg"}],"attr":[{"label":"生存能力","value":40},{"label":"攻击伤害","value":20},{"label":"技能效果","value":80},{"label":"上手难度","value":20}],"skills":[{"name":"人鱼之赐","cd":"0","cost":"0","desc":"朵莉亚在水域(河道也视为水域)会化为人鱼形态，减少50%所受的减速效果，并持续回复生命和法力。人鱼形态的普攻会射出水箭，造成范围伤害。 朵莉亚的【恢复】会替换为【人鱼之赐】，可与选定的队友建立契约，使用【天籁】时会优先选择契约队友。","icon":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/159/15900.png"},{"name":"欢歌","cd":"12(-0.4/Lv)","cost":"50(+10/Lv)","desc":"朵莉亚咏唱的声波向外扩散，造成法术伤害和减速。最后一道声波命中敌人时将激起回音，对触碰的敌人造成法术伤害。在水域释放时，最后一道声波还会激起水浪击退敌人。","icon":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/159/15910.png"},{"name":"逐浪","cd":"12(-0.4/Lv)","cost":"60(+5/Lv)","desc":"朵莉亚向前腾空跃起化为人鱼形态，若落点是地面，朵莉亚将创造一片水域，落地时为附近友方英雄回复生命，队友在水域中可与朵莉亚一样回复生命和法力。 若在水域释放，则返还25%冷却时间。朵莉亚离开自己创造的水域4秒后，水域消失。","icon":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/159/15920.png"},{"name":"天籁","cd":"10(-1/Lv)(+120%目标技能当前冷却)","cost":"100(+10/Lv)","desc":"朵莉亚短暂吟唱后，刷新范围内一名友军当前冷却时间最长的技能，由自己承担技能冷却。优先为契约队友刷新技能。","icon":"https://game.gtimg.cn/images/yxzj/img201606/heroimg/159/15930.png"}],"story":"","source":"https://pvp.qq.com/web201605/herodetail/159.shtml"}}